  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──では、桑山千雪さん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あなたにとって、結婚とはなんですか？\r\n一言でお答え下さい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020010,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "一言ですと『やってみないとわからないもの』という\r\n言葉になるでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020020"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……確かに、『一言で』とは言ったけど、\r\n意地悪な反応を引き出しそうな答えだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（本番で言われるより、\r\n今突っ込んでおいた方がいいか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やってみないとわからないもの──\r\n捨て鉢にも聞こえる言葉ですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結婚情報雑誌のキャンペーンガールは、\r\n顧客の結婚に対する気持ちをかきたてる仕事です",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "桑山さんのスタンスで、それが可能でしょうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい、できると思います",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020030"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（先に結論を持ってくるのはオーディション面接の基本だ\r\nちゃんと自信のある表情もできている、いいぞ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "理由をお伺いしてもよろしいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私は、以前は全く違う種類の職に就いていたので、\r\nこの世界に飛び込む時には、色々な迷いがありました",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "アイドルというお仕事の苦労は\r\n本気でやってみるまで、きっとわからない",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも……何かを大きく動かすためには、\r\n思いきりをつけて飛ぶことも大事だったんだなって",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "今はそんなふうに感じます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私は既婚者ではありませんが、\r\nそういう瞬間の価値については、わかるつもりです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結婚も、それと似たようなものだと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうですね\r\n少し、乱暴な捉え方かもしれませんが……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "不安があっても、相手が腕を広げて待ってくれていれば\r\n人間は、覚悟を決められるんだって思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "信じて、飛び込む……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "多少無茶だったかもしれませんが、\r\n最後のその思いきりがなければ、今の私はありませんでした",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結婚を考えている人に、そうしたメッセージを伝えたい……\r\nというのが志望動機であると捉えてもよろしいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もちろん、\r\n結婚については、もう少しシンプルな憧れもあります",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "テレビや雑誌で見るような、ドレス、ティアラ、\r\n色とりどりの花に囲まれて微笑むふたり────",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なんというか、未来への希望が溢れていますよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そういう私自身が抱く憧れは、広告物の上に\r\nきちんと表現していけるのではないかと思っています",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ご自身の憧れを通して、読者に結婚の魅力を伝えていけると",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ええ",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "広告を見た人が、結婚について考えてみて\r\n自分なら、こういう感じのものがしてみたいな……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なんて、夢見ることができるものをお届けしたいんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そして、私を通して、\r\nそれぞれが異なる『その先』を感じてもらえたら……",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "おこがましいかもしれませんが、\r\nそう考えています",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "テーマを真剣に考えていただいてありがとうございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『その先』……いいお言葉が聞けました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あの、はい……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……大げさなものじゃなくて、\r\n物語の余白みたいなもの、と言いますか……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "結婚をしても、しなくても、した後も……\r\n未来には色んな物語が待っていると思います",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私が何かを表現させていただくことで、\r\n見てくださる方の心に、あり得るかもしれない余白を描けたら",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020270,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そんなふうに思っています",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020270"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかりました\r\n……桑山さんの方から、何か質問はありますか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020280,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうですね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020290,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "この仕事において、\r\n御誌が私に求めるものは、どのようなことでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020300,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "生意気かもしれませんが、\r\nそれに合わせて、私なりの物語を作れたら……と思いまして",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020300"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いろんな意味で、難しい質問が飛んできたぞ……！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そうだな……）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "桑山千雪さん、\r\nでしょうか",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "優しさや包容力です",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "驚き、でしょうか",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今、こうして話してくださっている\r\nあなた自身であっていただければと思いますよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020310,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……あの\r\n……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020320,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "その、課題といいますか\r\n求めておられるイメージですとか、稼働の仕方ですとか……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、ええ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このままいきましょう、ということです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013020330,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601302/2016013020330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日は、有意義な会話のキャッチボールを\r\n行うことができたと思っています",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、千雪……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
